l8589998395: 610 l8589998394 l8589998209 # @created_ns:1795346686848154330 Has value (Has a (Is an instance of (Enclosing document, Built-in type identifier: Routine), Description), "Splits `input` at each non-overlapping left-to-right occurrence of `sep`.\nWhen `sep` is non-empty, preserves leading, trailing, and adjacent empty slices so\n`implode sep (explode sep x) == x`. When `sep` is empty (`b\"\"`), splits `input` into\nindividual 1-byte slices (`explode b\"\" b\"\" == []` and `explode b\"\" b\"abc\" == [b\"a\", b\"b\", b\"c\"]`).")
l8589998396: 584 l8589978240 573 # @created_ns:1795346686848154330 Has a (Is an instance of (Enclosing document, Built-in type identifier: Routine), Description)
l8589998397: 610 l8589998396 l8589978364 # @created_ns:1795346686848154330 Has value (Has a (Is an instance of (Enclosing document, Built-in type identifier: Routine), Description), "Concatenates `parts` in linear `O(N)` time inserting `sep` between adjacent slices.")
l8589998398: 584 l8589978243 573 # @created_ns:1795346686848154330 Has a (Is an instance of (Enclosing document, Built-in type identifier: Routine), Description)
l8589998399: 610 l8589998398 l8589998210 # @created_ns:1795346686848154330 Has value (Has a (Is an instance of (Enclosing document, Built-in type identifier: Routine), Description), "StageL-internal Euclidean modulus satisfying `0 <= (modStageLInternal lhs rhs) < |rhs|` for all `rhs != 0`\n(including `modStageLInternal i32Min -1 == 0` and `modStageLInternal -1 i32Min == i32Max`); faults when `rhs == 0`.")
